Module 8: STM32F407 + TFT UI (Display & Control)

Purpose:
- Provide user interface, controls, rendering of waveform, measurements (frequency, period, peak, average), and data storage/communication.

Schematic description:
- MCU: STM32F407VET6
- TFT: ILI9341 or ILI9486 320x240 display using 16-bit parallel interface connected to FSMC
  - FSMC D0..D15 -> TFT data pins
  - Control signals: TFT_CS, TFT_RS, TFT_WR, TFT_RD, RESET
- Buttons/Encoders: GPIOs with external pullups; rotary encoder for timebase/volts/div
- SD Card: SDIO interface for waveform storage
- USB: USB FS for PC comms

Software architecture:
- ISR: DMA half/full callbacks, EXTI for buttons
- Tasks: Capture control, Render task (double-buffer), Measurement task, Storage/Comm task

Verification:
- Test UI responsiveness while continuous reading frames; ensure double-buffer prevents tearing.
